  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Sometimes when VRChat conducts OpenBeta testing with inventory stuff, they will give us these things, but then remove them afterwards once testing has ended. I feel this action is very rude to do to us. The reason I bring this up now is because VRChat recently gave us accessories and a REALLY cool cube, BUT with the warning that these will be removed from our inventory after the testing has concluded. And honestly, I REALLY like the Exclusive Reference Cube with its abstract work and I really don't want to part with it after the test has conducted, especially when you consider that someone spent the time and effort to make this item, I dislike it when well made things are wasted and forgotten. So I request that the Exclusive Reference Cube not be removed from the users' inventory  after testing has concluded please.",
